    "answer": "### 项目治理建议：优先评估 slingshot\n\n### 已核验科学依据\n- **slingshot · 方法类型：** Here, we introduce Slingshot, a novel lineage inference tool designed for multiple branching lineages.[1]\n- **slingshot · 输入要求：** We start from an n×J matrix of normalized expression measures (e.g., read counts) for n single cells and J genes or features.[2]\n- **slingshot · 主要限制：** Slingshot assumes that the n cells have been partitioned into K clusters, potentially corresponding to distinct cellular states.[2]\n\n### 项目治理资格\n- 状态：仅规划候选。这是项目内资格边界，不代表跨数据集科学优越性。\n\n### 建议步骤\n1. 先完成 DataProfile 与合同核对。\n2. 在同一条件下做小规模对照，并由人工复核后再确定方案。\n\n### 参考资料\n[1] slingshot · recovered_af8ffd0ec6b54e81 · source-artifact:7114f7708cd37af0bbb6b872cf9e014b/xml:/article/body/sec[1]/p[4];text-sha256:2e29926f594881988dbe8b4140268a40f9824cc2c7c1597ab5d78aac1d839a70:5782:7144\n[2] slingshot · recovered_af8ffd0ec6b54e81 · source-artifact:7114f7708cd37af0bbb6b872cf9e014b/xml:/article/body/sec[4]/p[1];text-sha256:2e29926f594881988dbe8b4140268a40f9824cc2c7c1597ab5d78aac1d839a70:39200:39937\n[3] slingshot · recovered_af8ffd0ec6b54e81 · source-artifact:7114f7708cd37af0bbb6b872cf9e014b/xml:/article/body/sec[2]/list[1]/list-item[2]/p[1];text-sha256:2e29926f594881988dbe8b4140268a40f9824cc2c7c1597ab5d78aac1d839a70:10255:10529\n[4] slingshot · recovered_d6860402b8452a84 · source-artifact:665ae105d6446f1801cf60ea8eb1b8ca/text-sha256:318da69316178f266237813f15865f1e9d9451978dd938a867fa3c72a466e0a9:394:682\n[5] slingshot · recovered_af8ffd0ec6b54e81 · source-artifact:7114f7708cd37af0bbb6b872cf9e014b/xml:/article/body/sec[4]/sec[1]/sec[2]/p[2];text-sha256:2e29926f594881988dbe8b4140268a40f9824cc2c7c1597ab5d78aac1d839a70:44325:45659\n[6]  · recovered_d6860402b8452a84 · source-artifact:665ae105d6446f1801cf60ea8eb1b8ca/text-sha256:318da69316178f266237813f15865f1e9d9451978dd938a867fa3c72a466e0a9:493:682\n[7]  · recovered_af8ffd0ec6b54e81 · source-artifact:7114f7708cd37af0bbb6b872cf9e014b/xml:/article/body/sec[3]/p[5];text-sha256:2e